界面参数配置 (Interface Parameters)
主要参数 (Sliders/Choosers/Switches)

authority-regime: chooser ["advisor" "pure-voter" "hybrid-voter"]
centralized?: switch (on/off)
coverage: slider (0.0 to 1.0, default 0.5, step 0.1)
wAI: slider (0 to 10, default 1, step 0.5)
A: slider (0.5 to 1.0, default 0.75, step 0.05)
N: slider (10 to 100, default 30, step 10)
rounds: slider (10 to 500, default 100, step 10)
meanTrust: slider (0.0 to 1.0, default 0.6, step 0.1)
sdTrust: slider (0.0 to 0.5, default 0.15, step 0.05)
meanConform: slider (0.0 to 1.0, default 0.5, step 0.1)
sdConform: slider (0.0 to 0.5, default 0.15, step 0.05)

监视器 (Monitors)
text
accuracy
cascade-rate
false-convergence
polarisation
mean-trust
mean-trust-instantaneous
trust-drift
access-rate

图表 (Plots)
Accuracy Over Time
  Plot: accuracy vs. ticks
Trust Evolution
  Plot: mean-trust and mean-trust-instantaneous vs. ticks
Belief Distribution
  Histogram of [belief] of turtles

